      "source": [
        "## Recommendation\n",
        "\n",
        "Based on the summary statistics, I would choose **sunflower feed** for the business. It has the highest average chick weight at **328.92**, so it produces the heaviest chickens on average. It also has the highest minimum weight at **226** and the highest maximum weight at **423**, which makes its results strong at both extremes. Casein is the closest alternative because its mean weight is **323.58**, but its minimum and maximum weights are both lower than sunflower feed. Because sunflower performs best on the average while also having the strongest minimum and maximum, I would buy sunflower feed."
